  "scope_contract": {
    "status": "R01_feedback_applied_candidate",
    "ref": "2026-11-24 R01 대화: 인증 도중에 등록 범위 변경 문제는 없다고 보는데 굳이 대응하자면 실행 이후에는 되돌리기는 없다고 고지해서 중간의 변경을 없애는 게 좋을 것 같은데 이미 출발한 열차를 멈추는 건 특별한 일이 아니고는 오히려 어려워",
    "lock_event": "accept_job",
    "pre_start": "등록 내용/자료는 작업 수락 전에 확인·수정. 인증 단계에는 별도 등록 편집 동작 없음; 필요하면 인증 종료 후 준비로 돌아감. 수정한 계획은 기존 승인 무효화. 계정/대상 변경은 새 요청/대상 재확인.",
    "locked": "작업 수락부터 실행 범위 불변. 원본/계획 내용의 인플레이스 변경, 중간 단계 삭제/재설정, 자동 역행/rollback 없음. 다른 등록 요청은 별개로 중복/효과 검사. 상태/권한/인증 및 동일 범위 안전 복구는 변경과 구분.",
    "exception": "작업 수락 후 내용·대상 변경/rollback 없음. 인증/권한 상실, 실행 조건 변경, 사용자 중단 또는 안전상 종료는 단일 request_stop 경로. 중단하지 않은 일시적 확인 대기는 같은 고정 범위에서만 안전 확인 후 명시 재개. 중단/실패/완료는 종료.",
    "notice": "등록 시작 후에는 등록 내용을 변경하거나 이미 실행된 외부 동작을 되돌릴 수 없습니다. 중단이 필요한 경우 이후 동작을 중지하며, 이미 처리된 결과는 남을 수 있습니다. 확인이 필요한 경우 결과와 다음 조치를 안내합니다."
  },
  "stop_contract": {
    "revision": "single-terminal-stop-v1",
    "user_ref": "2026-11-24 R01: 중단 중에 어떤 일이 발생하더라도 중단하고 결과를 보여주면 되고 상태 정의는 제대로 하면 되잖아 복잡할 거 하나도 없는데",
    "entry": "request_stop",
    "terminal": "stopped",
    "completion_event": "finish_stop",
    "implementation_rows": [
      "finish_stop_pending",
      "finish_stop_other"
    ],
    "stop_reason": "metadata only: append reason/fact observations, no reason-specific lifecycle or transition. Revocation/expiry recorded in authoritative security ledger; no new external command admitted from stopping/stopped.",
    "outcome": "Return stop status + last confirmed step(s)/effects + unresolved attempt or goal uncertainty + evidence and next action. Never invent success or rollback. Even if readback not possible, terminate with incomplete/unknown result rather than wait indefinitely.",
    "late_evidence": "After stopped, trusted evidence under separately authorized read-only observation may append a newer result record; lifecycle stays stopped even if the external goal is later confirmed. No automatic resume, new mutation, new attempt, or stage reset. A distinct future request requires slot/effect duplicate check and new authorization. Late result projection tested separately; actual readback execution and evidence validation deferred.",
    "recovery": "waiting은 중단 요청 없는 확인 대기. 중단 처리 및 종료는 다시 실행하지 않음.",
    "blocked": "작업 생성 전 eligibility로 표현. 권한/인증이 실행 수락 후 상실되면 request_stop.",
    "limit": "Real admission fencing, stop timeout, evidence authority, external side effects and security ledger synchronization need actual implementation test."
  },
  "cross_contracts": [
    "USER는 CO를 통해 업무 요청/결과를 이용한다. 원격 화면의 사용자 입력만 CO가 부여한 grant로 EXEC의 제한된 입력 경계에 연결된다. 로그인 입력은 PREP/LLM/기록으로 전달하지 않는다.",
    "CO owns lifecycle/plan/approval, PREP owns verified source and per-platform draft, KNOW owns route/rule/allowed action/goal criteria, EXEC owns session/control/admission/attempt, RESULT owns trusted observations and outcome proof. Owners exchange commands/results or append records; STORE is a shared persistence/atomic boundary, not a decision-maker. In one transaction CO lifecycle and EXEC/RESULT evidence changes use explicit typed events; no callback inside admission lock.",
    "Source confirmation is platform-neutral. Target draft confirmation proves current source and exact platform rule/field mapping; missing values ask before authentication/approval. No separate user approval of every execution step. Confirm facts and one platform plan execution separately.",
    "Authentication is not a separate workflow status. While HUMAN has control, only registered auth interactions; after input fencing READ verifies identity; account change or re-auth before acceptance invalidates prior target/plan/approval. After acceptance no rebind or content edit; loss of current authorized account stops. Service auth separate.",
    "Eligibility is derived; supported route is not permission. Platform-specific action plan contains ordered logical operations, effects and evidence requirements. The runner admits one operation per durable attempt under current owner, scope, rule, target, policy, generation/revision, before state, unresolved effect, and stop predicates. Current read permission independently verified.",
    "Result uncertainty is a fact about operation/goal evidence, not a distinct lifecycle. waiting permits read-only recovery while unresolved, then explicit resume of same scope only after safe next operation proof; step3 is goal-only read, never admission. Once stopped/failed/done, external object observations may append to result, never reopen lifecycle.",
    "Shared immutable source version, per-platform plan/approval/job/ledger; same stable target and logical effect across keys/new requests. Existing goal returns existing evidence, ambiguous/unresolved blocks creation. Different account/platform/slot separately identified with owner isolation. No external exactly-once or rollback claim.",
    "Actual permission, identity, action/goal evidence and concurrent fencing are external obligations. Mock-only fixed; live access denied until separate permission/phase approval."
  ],
  "deferred": [
    "Soomgo real registration object/evidence, live permission and user value",
    "Concrete mock action/field schema, UI/API/DB, actual concurrency/atomic admission/fencing, browser isolation/credential handling, real security ledger and authorized readback",
    "Production stable slot identity, durable idempotency and trusted evidence verification; synthetic protocol model only",
    "Stop finalization deadline and actual worker fencing; logical termination does not prove runtime termination"
  ],
